==Bavarian==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|bar|gmh|wider}}, from {{inh|bar|goh|widar||against}}, from {{inh|bar|gem-pro|*wiþer}}. Cognates include {{cog|de|wieder}} and {{cog|yi|ווידער}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|Vienna}} {{IPA|bar|/ˈvita/}}
* {{hyph|bar|wie|der}}

===Adverb===
{{head|bar|adverb}}

# {{lb|bar|Viennese}} [[again]]
#* {{quote-text|bar|title=Wien wörtlich|section=Impression im März|author=Josef Weinheber|year=1938|text=Wårme Sunn, dås erste Pråterveigerl:<br /> Ållweil '''wieder''' gfreust di wiara Kind.|t=Warm sun, the first violet:<br /> You always rejoice like a child '''again'''.}}

