===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ˈviːdɐ/}} {{a|standard}}
** {{audio|de|De-at-wieder.ogg|audio (Austria)}}
** {{audio|de|De-wieder.ogg|Audio}}
* {{IPA|de|/ˈvɪdɐ/}} {{a|regional|including western Germany|chiefly colloquial}}
* {{homophones|de|wider}}

